directions perpendicular to `f`.  The derived route family has three orbit
types: four equal pairs, eight perpendicular pairs, and four opposite pairs.
Every route step is either a legal straight Block24 append or a legal
perpendicular Block28 turn.  Exact local rows are reconstructed over `5,880`
