to ten QND Record writes and their Blank debit.

The `3,136` complete first-output Record controls are orthogonal.  On each
control, the selected ten-step channel is normalized.  Their direct sum plus
the complement STOP is consequently trace preserving on the full declared
space; complete positivity is explicit from the factored branch operators.
Translation, side exchange, and all 24 proper cubic rotations transport the
construction.  The runner checks `4,608` such proper-cubic transports.

At the reached frame, `6,144` literal second-use descriptors bind the two
supplied `q` laws to the eight still-Blank targets.  The second complement
STOP completes the channel, and summing over all second outputs returns the
first-use/handoff prefix exactly.  This is the claimed finite two-use cylinder
identity.

